    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35424" root="قرب" body-key="q">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَأْوٌ مُقَرِّبٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُقَرَّبٌ</span></b> , and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَلْ مِنْ مُقَرِّبَةِ خَبَرٍ</span>
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَبَرٍ</span> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُقَرَّبَةِ</span></b> , occur thus written, probably by
mistake, the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ق</span> being thus put in the place of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غ</span>:
see [<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُغَرِّبٌ</span> in] art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غرب</span>. (TA.)

